@EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-a-JWT-here
@attendanceId = 1

### List and filter attendance
GET {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-31&department=Operations&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get one attendance record
GET {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Summary for a date
GET {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/summary?date=2026-10-18
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create attendance
POST {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "attendanceDate": "2026-10-18",
  "status": "Present",
  "checkInTime": "2026-10-18T08:30:00Z",
  "notes": "On time"
}

### Update attendance
PUT {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "attendanceDate": "2026-10-18",
  "status": "Late",
  "checkInTime": "2026-10-18T09:15:00Z",
  "notes": "Updated check-in"
}

### Check out (server records the current UTC time)
POST {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete attendance (Admin role required)
DELETE {{EmployeeMng.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
